# Check every text file out with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says
# (Git for Windows defaults it to true): the snapshot tests compare generated
# Rust and diagnostics byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Approved images (PNG) are binary: never convert their bytes.
*.png binary

# Our own assistant's instructions are not published: the public tree is
# made with git archive, which leaves these out. AGENTS.md is the public one.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
.claude/** export-ignore
